# A world's manifest hash is FNV-1a-64 over the raw bytes of manifest.toml, and every .bvx stores
# the hash it was baked against. Any line-ending translation invalidates the whole world
# ("manifest hash mismatch for region ..."). See GODOT_INTEGRATION.md §9.1.
*.toml -text

# Binary containers: raw little-endian POD dumps, never text.
*.bvx binary
*.btx binary
